      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Some of the leaders of the Israelites came to consult me about the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s will. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " spoke to me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mortal man,” he said, “these men have given their hearts to idols and are letting idols lead them into sin. Do they think I will give them an answer?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Now speak to them and tell them what I, the Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", am saying to them: every Israelite who has given his heart to idols and lets them lead him into sin and who then comes to consult a prophet, will get an answer from me — the answer that his many idols deserve! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All those idols have turned the Israelites away from me, but by my answer I hope to win back their loyalty.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Now then, tell the Israelites what I, the Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", am saying: turn back and leave your disgusting idols.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Whenever one of the Israelites or one of the foreigners who live in the Israelite community turns away from me and worships idols, and then goes to consult a prophet, I, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", will give him his answer! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will oppose him. I will make an example of him. I will remove him from the community of my people, so that you will know that I am the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“If a prophet is deceived into giving a false answer, it is because I, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", have deceived him. I will remove him from the people of Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Both the prophet and the one who consults him will get the same punishment. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will do this to keep the Israelites from deserting me and defiling themselves by their sins. They are to be my people, and I will be their God.” The Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has spoken.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " spoke to me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mortal man,” he said, “if a country sins and is unfaithful to me, I will stretch out my hand and destroy its supply of food. I will send a famine and kill people and animals alike. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Even if those three men, Noah, Danel,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14.14",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Danel",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ": or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Daniel,",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "an ancient hero, known for his righteous life.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and Job, were living there, their goodness would save only their own lives.” The Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has spoken.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
