          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Or I might send wild animals to kill the people, making the land so dangerous that no one could travel through it, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and even if those three men lived there — as surely as I, the Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", am the living God — they would not be able to save even their own children. They would save only their own lives, and the land would become a wilderness.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
